sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant E as Extractor
    participant S3 as Policy Data S3
    participant CDA as CDA
    participant PE as Premium Data Events
    participant AP as AP Data Mart
    participant BP as Monthly Batch Process

    E->>E: Extract data from System A
    E->>E: Determine processing date

    alt Before Aug 21, 2026
        E->>S3: Read Policy Data
        S3-->>E: Policy Data

        E->>CDA: Read CDA Data
        CDA-->>E: CDA Data

        E->>E: Convert to Earnix Format
        E->>CDA: Supplement Missing Data
        CDA-->>E: Missing Data

        E->>E: Convert to Target System Format
        Note right of E: True → Y<br/>False → F<br/>etc.

        E->>AP: Write data
        AP-->>E: Acknowledge

    else Aug 21, 2026 and later
        E->>PE: Read Premium Data Events
        PE-->>E: Premium Events

        E->>AP: Write data
        AP-->>E: Acknowledge
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note over BP,AP: Runs Monthly
        BP->>AP: Read AP Data Mart
        AP-->>BP: AP Data

        BP->>BP: Generate AP File
        BP-->>AP: Processing complete
    end
